@startuml
title SC-ORD-010 — Two things happen to the same order at the same instant
participant "Order\n(saga)" as O
participant "Inventory" as I
participant "Payment" as P

O ->> I : ReserveStock
note over I : slow
I ->> O : StockReserved
O -> O : order deadline reached
note over O : two handlers load the saga\nat version 3, at the same time
note over O : deadline handler saves first:\nCOMPENSATED, version 4,\nReleaseReservation to send
O ->> I : ReleaseReservation
note over O : StockReserved handler tries to save:\nversion conflict, nothing is saved,\nthe message is not acknowledged
I ->> O : StockReserved (delivered again)
note over O : saga is COMPENSATED:\nReleaseReservation is sent again
note over P : never called
@enduml
